---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="about-hero py-3">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-3">
        <h1>About Me</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content">
        <div class="about-text fade-in">
          <h2>Marco Antonio Romero Albanez</h2>
          <p class="subtitle">
            Computer Engineering Student | Backend Developer | .NET & Angular
            Enthusiast
          </p>

          <p>
            I'm a passionate software developer from <strong
              >Matanzas, Cuba</strong
            > 🇨🇺 currently in my 3rd year of Computer Engineering. I specialize in
            building robust, scalable applications with focus on <strong
              >.NET and Angular</strong
            >.
          </p>

          <p>
            With experience as a freelancer and teaching assistant, I bring both
            technical expertise and strong collaboration skills to every
            project. I'm passionate about clean code, software architecture, and
            creating solutions that make a real impact.
          </p>

          <h3>Education & Background</h3>
          <p>
            Currently pursuing my Computer Engineering degree while actively
            working on professional projects. My academic background combined
            with hands-on experience has given me a solid foundation in both
            theoretical concepts and practical application.
          </p>

          <h3>Languages</h3>
          <div class="languages">
            <div class="language-item">
              <span class="language-name">Spanish</span>
              <div class="language-level">
                <div class="level-bar" style="width: 100%"></div>
                <span class="level-text">Native</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="language-item">
              <span class="language-name">English</span>
              <div class="language-level">
                <div class="level-bar" style="width: 65%"></div>
                <span class="level-text">B1 Intermediate</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-3" style="background-color: var(--secondary-black);">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="text-center mb-3">My Journey</h2>

      <div class="journey-timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">Jan 2025 - Present</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Freelance Development</h3>
            <p>
              I Developed an mini ERP System that has been rented by three
              Companies at my locality. I'm currently working with another
              developer to create an ERP system for global use.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">Oct 2025 - Dec 2025</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>University Teaching Assistant</h3>
            <p>
              I work on my soft skills by teaching other students
              how to code and how to think as a developer.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">Feb 2025 - May 2025</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>IT Intern</h3>
            <p>
              I was there to ensure that the internal databases 
              were working correctly. My project for the university
              from from this experience was qualificated as the best
              one in my year.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">May 2024 - Oct 2022</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>IT Department Lead</h3>
            <p>
              This was my first experience working with clients.
              I developed 4 desktop applications using JavaFX and
              Spring for Cultural Events.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    min-height: 60vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-text h2 {
    color: var(--primary-white);
    border: none;
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--primary-red);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-text h3 {
    color: var(--primary-white);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .languages {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .language-item {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .language-name {
    display: block;
    color: var(--primary-white);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .language-level {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .level-bar {
    flex-grow: 1;
    height: 8px;
    background-color: var(--primary-red);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .level-text {
    color: #ddd;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    min-width: 100px;
  }

  .journey-timeline {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--medium-gray);
  }

  .timeline-year {
    min-width: 120px;
    color: var(--primary-red);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .timeline-content h3 {
    color: var(--primary-white);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-content p {
    color: #ddd;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .timeline-item {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .timeline-year {
      min-width: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
